  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>&lt;기체반응 법칙&gt;</b></span> 에&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">정말 너무너무너무 x 100</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">좋은 시뮬레이션 자료입니다.&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">수석님 감사드려요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">아이들이 &lt;실험실 연구원&gt;이라는 컨셉</span></b>으로</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">부피비를 찾는 수업 진행했습니다.&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">조별로 역할을 나누고,</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">전체 결과를 수합하였습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">활동시간은 20분 정도 소요되고,</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">대부분의 팀이 잘 찾았습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0a9c3696ee14d44ab38bd6f5e3002194c3acff80\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0a9c3696ee14d44ab38bd6f5e3002194c3acff80\" data-origin-width=\"1163\" data-origin-height=\"825\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">아이들에게 <b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">&lt;굵은 선 박스&gt;인 부분</span></b>은</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">스스로 쓰는 내용이라고 했습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e6fe31c4dc900a7d409e333a9e4a80aac465564f?download\" data-file-name=\"[활동지]기체반응의법칙_시뮬레이션.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"78042\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D1143%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20240327125151&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fe6fe31c4dc900a7d409e333a9e4a80aac465564f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">[활동지]기체반응의법칙_시뮬레이션</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">76.21KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
